{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">76歲的薛家燕（家燕姐）向來深受大眾喜愛，近日有網民在街頭「野生捕獲」她的身影。從網民分享的短片中可見，家燕姐當日以一身色彩奪目的造型示人，穿上湖綠色上衣並外搭桃紅色運動套裝，顯得格外精神奕奕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"14a88184-57ef-4bc9-a0ee-4635fefa7957.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Z11fwKwUBB1786614167.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"14a88184-57ef-4bc9-a0ee-4635fefa7957.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"749752b8-f73e-4875-a1a0-1576a8af660f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026eM9NQoZwM11786614167.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"749752b8-f73e-4875-a1a0-1576a8af660f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">向來毫無架子的家燕姐，在街上遇見途人時立刻展露其標誌性的招牌笑容，並熱情地向大家揮手打招呼，親和力十足。許多網民看過片段後都踴躍留言，表示一看到家燕姐的笑臉就自然覺得開心；同時也有不少粉絲窩心叮囑她，在忙碌工作之餘務必要多加休息，好好保重身體。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T09:04:52.120388+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}